# Crystal Imperium balance test: Bugsy (trainer 404) at the badge-1 level cap (24). Since 0.8.0 he
# has an Imperium-style team of six (Ariados, Pineco, Ledian, Butterfree, Yanma, Scyther:
# boss_teams.py). Team: Quilava / Geodude / Flaaffy / Pidgeotto / Heracross / Onix, holding the
# first care package's Charcoal (Quilava) and two Eviolites (Flaaffy, Onix), never switching
# voluntarily (a deliberately naive line). 40 battles with different RNG must include at least
# one win (winnable with Pokemon caught before Azalea) and at least one loss (not a free badge).
# Measured on mGBA: 3 of 20 (2 of 24 with the Charcoal alone); Butterfree's Compound Eyes Sleep
# Powder does most of the damage to a team that never switches.
!new_game()
!battle_style_set()
!give_mon(156, 24)
!give_mon(74, 24)
!give_mon(180, 24)
!give_mon(17, 24)
!give_mon(214, 24)
!give_mon(95, 24)
!hold_item("ITEM_CHARCOAL", 0)
!hold_item("ITEM_EVIOLITE", 2)
!hold_item("ITEM_EVIOLITE", 5)
savestate team.ss
!battle_trainer(404)
wait 1100
expect16 {gBattleMons+136} 168 bugsy_leads_ariados
# Quilava Flame Wheel, Geodude Rock Throw, Flaaffy Thunder Shock, Pidgeotto Wing Attack, Heracross
# Aerial Ace, Onix Smack Down
!sample_battle(404, "1,0,0,3,1,3", runs=40, min_wins=1, max_wins=39)
